OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thu 24 Sep to Sat 3 OctFA
OL,6,Fchangeable period is expected, with
OL,7,FAtlantic weather systems bringing
OL,8,Fspells of rain, showers and occasional
OL,9,Fstrong winds. The wettest and windiest
OL,10,Fconditions are most likely across
OL,11,Fnorthern and western areas, although
OL,12,Fstronger winds may at times extend
OL,13,Fmore widely. Between these unsettled
OL,14,Fspells, periods of drier and more
OL,15,Fsettled weather are likely, especially
OL,16,Fin the south and east, where they may
OL,17,Flast for a few days. Accompanying
OL,18,Fthese may be some overnight fog and
OL,19,Ffrost. Temperatures are expected to be
OL,20,Fslightly above average overall.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
